                                "sense_id": "97bddc85-d058-3757-949e-9327c14471e3",
                                "text": "De ontbinding van de vereniging vond plaats in 1931.",
                                "translation": "The dissolution of the society took place in 1931.",
                                "english": "The dissolution of the society took place in 1931."
